"提示仅供参考，不是官方分级；观影前请按个人情况判断。":"For reference only, not an official rating; please use your own judgement before viewing.","儿童受虐":"Child abuse","针对女性的暴力":"Violence against women","放映格式":"Format","年龄提示":"Age advisory","无障碍":"Accessibility","在 Letterboxd 上查看":"View on Letterboxd","在 IMDb 上查看":"View on IMDb","在豆瓣上查看":"View on Douban","外部评分与影评":"External ratings and reviews","打开该站搜索结果":"Opens search results on that site","性暴力":"Sexual violence","暴力":"Violence","血腥":"Gore","自伤或自杀":"Self-harm or suicide","药物滥用":"Substance abuse","频闪／强光":"Flashing lights","动物伤害":"Animal harm","歧视性语言":"Discriminatory language","听障字幕场":"Captioned screening (deaf / hard of hearing)","无障碍影厅":"Wheelchair-accessible auditorium","建议16岁以上":"Recommended 16+","建议18岁以上":"Recommended 18+","建议12岁以上":"Recommended 12+","我的影片":"My films","搜索我的分类":"Search my categories","片目筛选":"Film library filters","全部影片":"All films","浏览完整片目":"Browse the full catalogue","已排片":"Planned","还没看过":"Not seen yet","主创映后场":"Filmmaker Q&A","主创映后":"Filmmaker Q&A","已保存在个人排片中的影片":"Films saved in your personal plan","收进观影护照的影片":"Films in your passport","继续探索新的银幕相遇":"Discover your next cinema experience","有主创映后活动的影片":"Films with filmmaker post-screening events","当前分类暂无影片":"No films in this category yet","在排片表中加入场次，就会出现在这里。":"Add a screening to your plan to see it here.","在影片页点「看过」，开始收集你的电影印章。":"Mark a film as seen to start collecting stamps.","换个分类，或试试片名、导演、演员。":"Try another category, title, director or cast member.","把每一次银幕相遇，收进自己的电影档案。":"A personal archive of every encounter with cinema.","每一场，":"Every screening,","都值得留下。":"a memory worth keeping.","看过、评分、盖章。":"Watch. Rate. Stamp.","让喜欢的电影，成为你的独家收藏。":"A collection that could only be yours.","轻触封面，翻开你的银幕旅程 ↗":"Open your passport. Your cinema journey awaits. ↗","查看我的已看影片":"Explore the films I have seen","跨设备继续你的观影记录":"Continue your cinema journey across devices","开幕片":"Opening Film","闭幕片":"Closing Film","金马奖入围影片":"Nominated Films","金马奖终身成就奖：虞戡平":"Lifetime Achievement Award: Yu Kan-ping",